Package: mtd-utils-dev
Version: 1.0-r1
Description: mtd-utils version 1.0-r1 - Development files
 Tools for managing memory technology devices.  This package contains
 symbolic links, header files, and related items necessary for software
 development.
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OE-Core Developers <openembedded-core@lists.openembedded.org>
License: GPLv2
Architecture: armv7a-vfp-neon
OE: mtd-utils
Depends: mtd-utils (= 1.0-r1)
Recommends: util-linux-dev, util-linux-libuuid-dev, libz-dev, liblzo2-dev, libc6-dev, e2fsprogs-dev
Source: file://mtd-utils
